Dialogue: 1,0:00:13.32,0:00:19.37,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Furusupiido de mawari hajimeta sutoorii
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.72,0:00:18.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:19.37,0:00:24.16,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,akaku daichi someageru
Dialogue: 1,0:00:25.46,0:00:31.71,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Chikyuugi ni wa garandou ni natta paradise
Dialogue: 1,0:00:31.71,0:00:36.39,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Bokura no te de sukuidasou
Dialogue: 1,0:00:37.34,0:00:43.02,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Hateshinaku tsuzuku sakamichi o
Dialogue: 1,0:00:43.02,0:00:47.73,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Ima omoikiri kakenukete far away
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.60,0:00:46.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.70,0:00:53.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to
Dialogue: 1,0:00:51.40,0:00:57.28,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Tachiagare! Yuusha wa boku no naka ni iru
Dialogue: 1,0:00:57.87,0:01:03.75,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Sobietatsu target makeru wake ni wa ikanai
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.98,0:01:00.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.89,0:01:01.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,here.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:03.75,0:01:09.84,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Moeagare! Kodou wa mune o kogashiteru
Dialogue: 1,0:01:09.84,0:01:16.47,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Wasurerareta ashita torimodoshi ni ikun da
Dialogue: 1,0:01:16.47,0:01:21.60,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Atsui batoru okose
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.14,0:01:33.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We found this great restaurant\Nbut didn't have any Digi-dollars,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.48,0:01:36.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so Digitamamon and I\Ngot in a big argument.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.18,0:01:39.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mimi's gorgeous friend from America,\NMichael, offered to pay the check.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.52,0:01:43.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,TK remembered that Digitamamon\Nwas evil, but he swore he changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.16,0:01:43.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.07,0:01:45.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't believe it for a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.74,0:01:48.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He proved I was right,\Ntoo, when he attacked Mimi.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.28,0:01:50.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's when I really let him have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.20,0:01:54.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Digi-Egg of Sincerity found me\Nin Hawk-Mon Digivolve to Dishiri-Mon,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.50,0:01:56.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,who destroyed\NDigi-Tom-A-Mon's dark spiral.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.90,0:02:01.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm glad to have a second Digi-Egg, but\NI'm more excited to see Michael again.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:03.56,0:02:09.98,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\fscx135\fscy135\pos(317,332)}Shurimon's Martial Arts
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.26,0:02:05.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shurimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.02,0:02:06.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Muget-cho!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.86,0:02:14.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those kids can forget this area.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.02,0:02:16.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all yours, boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.90,0:02:22.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,V-mon, hold still.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.50,0:02:24.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I still have to clean the\Ndirt off your toenails.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.60,0:02:27.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing, tap\Ndancing in a frying pan?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.32,0:02:29.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quit wiggling around so much, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.84,0:02:31.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.88,0:02:32.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It tickles every time you...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.79,0:02:33.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me at least wash under your arms.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.82,0:02:34.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't want to stink, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.00,0:02:36.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not under my arms, that's worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.26,0:02:38.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't I just be stinky? No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.36,0:02:41.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All my girlfriends will think\Nthat stink's coming from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.10,0:02:44.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm supposed to be washing you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.82,0:02:45.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.73,0:02:46.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to bust a gun and read it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.68,0:02:47.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just get out of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.76,0:02:56.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It could be just my imagination,\Nbut I think my family's gone nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.30,0:02:58.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now for news update.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.14,0:03:01.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kenneth Ichijochi, the boy genius,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.38,0:03:04.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,reported missing for the past two\Nmonths, has still not been found.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.48,0:03:07.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Police believe that he plotted his\Nown disappearance and are continuing
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.80,0:03:12.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,their investigation even though they\Nhave not had any solid leads so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.36,0:03:14.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.90,0:03:15.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.81,0:03:16.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was watching that!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.42,0:03:21.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dads have dibs on the remote,\Nespecially when it's your bedtime.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.98,0:03:25.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pick up your toys.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.16,0:03:26.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I almost fell on my butt.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.50,0:03:28.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like my space has been invaded.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.70,0:03:33.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My brother is getting on my nerves.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.00,0:03:36.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go to the Digi-World tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.50,0:03:38.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yoli's brother needs us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.34,0:03:44.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make sure you all get lots of sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.38,0:03:46.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll need it to fight\Nthe Digimon Emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.98,0:03:48.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.89,0:03:50.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Better snooze, or we'll lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.04,0:03:56.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen up, we got big trouble, you better\Nbelieve it, and it's really a dozy!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.34,0:03:57.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shogun Tokomon!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.74,0:04:00.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, he's probably wearing\Nthose hair plugs again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.34,0:04:02.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shogun Tokomon, we have an emergency!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.80,0:04:04.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.71,0:04:06.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wake up, this is no time to zone out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.36,0:04:08.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a total disaster, I tell ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.30,0:04:11.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon Emperor has put\Nup a control spire! What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.84,0:04:12.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.64,0:04:16.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on, Christian.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.92,0:04:18.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait till I get off this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.22,0:04:19.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid of life.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.12,0:04:26.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gadzooks, this is horrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.68,0:04:31.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Digimon Emperor's got his hot\Nlittle mitts on our territory.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.76,0:04:35.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We gotta do something or we're gonna\Nbe slaves for the rest of our lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.78,0:04:36.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.69,0:04:39.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Facing him is like a piccolo\Ngoing up against a tuba.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.84,0:04:42.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm too tired for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.80,0:04:58.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's about time davis let's get\Nmoving i'm kind of worried the digimon
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.88,0:05:02.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,emperor has really started to move\Nfaster i know one thing he's not
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.54,0:05:05.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,afraid of us or he wouldn't keep\Nfighting after losing all those battles
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.42,0:05:09.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,look huh this is what i'm talking\Nabout we better take the spin out of
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.96,0:05:13.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,his wheels and fast well I'm all for\Nthat I'm not gonna let that Brainiac
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.92,0:05:17.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,get the best of us yeah he's plotting\Nsomething big I can feel it if
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.98,0:05:21.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I were an evil genius what would I\Ndo he may have the brains but we have
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.20,0:05:25.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the brawn we've got to at least take\None of those areas back from him
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.02,0:05:34.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we're gonna teach that Digimon\NEmperor a lesson once and for all
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.96,0:05:47.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The dust is making my whiskers twitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.86,0:05:49.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This place is weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.32,0:05:50.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not to mention old.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.02,0:05:54.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's reminiscent of the samurai\Nera back in ancient Japan.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.18,0:05:56.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It could be a film set\Nfrom an old TV show.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.62,0:05:58.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My dad watched one of those last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.70,0:06:01.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think this is definitely\Nthe digital world.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.02,0:06:02.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.62,0:06:05.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a control spire.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.24,0:06:06.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a sure sign.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.30,0:06:08.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.88,0:06:11.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, red eyes give me the creeps.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.56,0:06:13.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This looks bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.22,0:06:15.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are they waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.82,0:06:17.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They already have us surrounded.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.28,0:06:27.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Me, my big mouth!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.96,0:06:31.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Poor along!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.62,0:06:33.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We may look like flowers, but watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.12,0:06:38.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our rain of pollen will make hay\Nfever seem like a walk in the roses!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.12,0:06:40.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're Mushroomon!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.58,0:06:42.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You definitely don't want\Nus in your fetchy omelet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.78,0:06:43.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We may be cute as buttons,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.04,0:06:47.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but our Fungus Cruncher will\Nleave you scratching your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.36,0:06:49.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rain of Pollock coming at ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.62,0:06:51.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fungus Cruncher!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.10,0:06:55.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stand back!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.34,0:07:01.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're no much for me, Cuddle Mod!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.62,0:07:03.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.70,0:07:10.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm too tired to play anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.82,0:07:12.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I'll take a nap now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.58,0:07:13.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fungus Cruncher!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.14,0:07:15.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Puppies!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.08,0:07:19.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not getting right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.46,0:07:20.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've had it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.50,0:07:26.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who did that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.42,0:07:30.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should have known.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.10,0:07:32.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That dot belongs to Ninjabon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.60,0:07:34.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'll attack at the most\Ninappropriate moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.02,0:07:37.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's a very vulgar Digimon, if you ask me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.54,0:07:39.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.45,0:07:41.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I managed to miss you this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.26,0:07:42.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.17,0:07:43.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was just practicing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.58,0:07:46.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But this time, I'm going\Nto split some feathers.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.16,0:07:48.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you think you're the\Ntop ninja, think again.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.74,0:07:49.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.84,0:07:52.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry to tell you, but you're\Nnumber two on the food chain.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.00,0:07:53.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.91,0:07:55.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What birdbrain calls himself number one?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.36,0:08:00.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid that has to be me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.12,0:08:01.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Try him and see.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.00,0:08:16.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, the samurai of sincerity.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.62,0:08:22.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a pretty fancy move,\Nbut I'm not afraid of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.72,0:08:23.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wanna see some more?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.14,0:08:25.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about this one, big shot?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.30,0:08:34.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go, Cherrymon!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.86,0:08:37.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're better than the movie! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.08,0:08:41.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fungus Cruncher!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.18,0:08:42.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pollen Peanut!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.86,0:08:49.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Behead my diamond shell! Boom, bubble!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.54,0:08:50.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lightning paw!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.10,0:08:53.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're under his spell!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.54,0:08:56.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are so many of them, how\Ncan we possibly free them off?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.30,0:08:59.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Help, you guys, these fungus\Nroids won't give me a break!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.16,0:09:00.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.74,0:09:07.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, you can hide down here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.24,0:09:10.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.15,0:09:10.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gekomon?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.07,0:09:12.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry it up before they find ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.86,0:09:14.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can escape down below!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.90,0:09:18.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A manhole cover!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.38,0:09:21.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wasn't under the impression that\Nthey had those things in ancient Japan.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.62,0:09:23.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got to realize that\Nthis is the digital world.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.06,0:09:25.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anything can happen here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.36,0:09:26.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who cares?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.36,0:09:28.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quit talking and hustle down, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.76,0:09:29.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wind it up, Jureimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.86,0:09:30.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got to move.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.86,0:09:33.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, we've got a schedule to keep.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.94,0:09:35.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop fighting and come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.20,0:09:39.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but duty calls and so does Yolene.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.02,0:09:43.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll see each other again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.28,0:09:48.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On behalf of the Gekomon, we thank\Nyou from the bottom of our horns.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.34,0:09:50.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you hadn't shown up\Nand come through for us,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.38,0:09:53.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we'd still be servants\Nof the Digimon Emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.98,0:09:57.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We appreciate what you did for\Nus to save our lives. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.48,0:10:00.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys are a lot nicer\Nthan the last time I saw you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.62,0:10:01.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You sure were evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.14,0:10:03.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not that I'm blaming you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.58,0:10:06.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd be pretty mean, too, if\NI had a dark ring around me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.42,0:10:09.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that's all over with\Nnow and we're friends again.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.58,0:10:11.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me, is this where\Nyou guys are living?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.92,0:10:13.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Down here beneath the ground?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.46,0:10:14.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid that's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.88,0:10:16.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the only safe place to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.88,0:10:18.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you guys give us the inside scoop on
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.02,0:10:21.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,where the Digimon Emperor\Nis hiding these days?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.32,0:10:23.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hasn't shown his face around here yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.70,0:10:25.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he's been incognito!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.54,0:10:28.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Dark Rinks just flew right in here\Nand brainwashed everyone in sight!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.90,0:10:33.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That means the Digimon Emperor knows\Nwhere you are and he can find you again!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.52,0:10:38.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't want to be the\NDigimon Emperor slaves again!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.24,0:10:39.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was way too awful!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.38,0:10:44.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shogun, Tokomon, do you\Nhave any good ideas?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.82,0:10:45.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We do!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.54,0:10:48.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That simple, my little friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.72,0:10:49.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, what do you mean by that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.04,0:10:51.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mmm...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.80,0:10:53.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mmm...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.26,0:10:56.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mmm...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.48,0:10:57.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.74,0:10:59.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mmm...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.44,0:11:01.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mmm...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.66,0:11:02.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We sleep!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.04,0:11:04.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That'll help.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.04,0:11:17.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but snoozing on\Nthe job's counterproductive!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.64,0:11:30.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's yours, Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.58,0:11:51.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First, before we do anything else,\Nwe have to destroy the Control Spire.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.16,0:11:52.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aw, that's no problem at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.70,0:11:54.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All we have to do is armor Digivolve.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.60,0:11:55.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a cinch.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.51,0:11:56.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you think so, Veeamon?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.43,0:11:59.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, besides, we're not talking about\Nwhat you call Big Muscle Digimon, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.54,0:12:02.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Most of them would rather\Ntoss a salad instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.76,0:12:05.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's an earthquake!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.68,0:12:07.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hate earthquakes!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.18,0:12:10.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It reminds me of my brother\Nwaking me every morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.68,0:12:11.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Oli.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.68,0:12:12.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.59,0:12:13.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all over now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.34,0:12:18.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This sugar's come unglued!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.22,0:12:19.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's tearing the place apart!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.46,0:12:20.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't know what to do!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.20,0:12:28.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dangle! Dangle! Dangle! Dangle!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.30,0:12:33.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gekko! Gekko! Gekko!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.70,0:12:36.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, look, he's got a dark spiral!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.70,0:12:39.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've seen him in action before.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.64,0:12:41.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shogun Gekomon is an Ultimate Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.04,0:12:43.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You may think he just toots his horn,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.74,0:12:46.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but he can play a note so flat,\Nit'll flatten everything around him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.00,0:12:48.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gekomon, I'm back the\Nway before you get...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.98,0:12:49.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,get down!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.92,0:12:53.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me help!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.12,0:12:57.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't stop, I can't get\Nout of here! Watch out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.54,0:13:02.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, that's being controlled\Nby the Digimon Emperor!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.12,0:13:03.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're in trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.90,0:13:06.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's big and obnoxious, but we like him!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.34,0:13:07.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you do something?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.40,0:13:08.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.31,0:13:09.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course, just leave it to us!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.62,0:13:10.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,TK, step it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.82,0:13:12.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They've got us all surrounded!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.20,0:13:22.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Devimon, let's plant\Nthese guys! I'm with ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.34,0:13:28.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimental Up!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.44,0:13:31.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.08,0:13:35.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Demon, Armor Digivolve!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.80,0:13:43.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon! Marlene, jumping!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.72,0:13:45.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dino Armor Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.36,0:13:51.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dredamar, the storm of friendship!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.00,0:13:53.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon Narlene Jumping!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.76,0:13:56.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take him down, Patamon! Digimon Narlene!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.44,0:13:59.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, Narlene!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.54,0:14:00.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a light guide!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.70,0:14:04.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.74,0:14:07.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gatomon Armor Digivolve to! Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.10,0:14:09.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digital Monsters!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.36,0:14:10.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon are the champions!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.38,0:14:12.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.30,0:14:13.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digital Monsters!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.48,0:14:15.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon are the champions!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.08,0:14:19.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Armors! Digivolve!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.70,0:14:21.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pegasmon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.06,0:14:22.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fire and roll!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.80,0:14:25.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.54,0:14:31.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digi-Armor Energize!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.34,0:14:35.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.78,0:14:38.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tailmon, Armor Digivolve!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.44,0:14:41.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digital Monsters, Digimon\Nare the champions!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.02,0:14:42.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.16,0:14:45.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digital Monsters, Digimon\Nare the champions!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.12,0:14:49.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.76,0:14:52.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gatomon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.02,0:14:54.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Angel of Light!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.44,0:14:56.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.36,0:15:02.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digi Armor, energize!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.82,0:15:08.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Armadimon, armor Digivolve to...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.80,0:15:12.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, digital monsters,\NDigimon are the champions!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.78,0:15:16.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, digital monsters,\NDigimon are the champions!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.16,0:15:23.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Armor, Digimon, Digimon,\Nthe drill of power!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.94,0:15:26.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.86,0:15:28.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's join the troops, Hawkmon!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.52,0:15:29.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.96,0:15:35.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a note on this dog, from Ninjaman.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.36,0:15:37.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What does it say?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.04,0:15:39.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He wants to challenge me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.70,0:15:43.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What kind of challenge?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.22,0:15:46.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Equus Beam.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.42,0:15:48.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's I-Beam.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.64,0:15:52.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it's not working.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.94,0:15:54.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He didn't even yawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.18,0:15:56.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, just mellow out, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.32,0:15:59.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't live?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.26,0:16:03.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I have enough vegetables.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.54,0:16:04.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Laughing smash-out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.44,0:16:09.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.70,0:16:12.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll put them in the\Ngarden where they belong.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.26,0:16:13.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rock cracking!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.86,0:16:20.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think he's doing up here?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.14,0:16:20.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Meditating.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.52,0:16:22.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.06,0:16:24.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.38,0:16:28.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I accept your dance invitation.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.84,0:16:30.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good, then Lance Bucky!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.04,0:16:33.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, knock that\Nlittle twerp socks off!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.22,0:16:36.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Missed me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.76,0:16:42.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys are a lot nicer\Nthan the last time I saw you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.32,0:16:51.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you're supposed to win this!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.66,0:16:55.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Musical Fist!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.80,0:17:01.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was close.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.42,0:17:05.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way we'll be able to\Ndefeat an ultimate on our own.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.34,0:17:10.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Somehow we've got to get him\Nto destroy the control spire.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.56,0:17:12.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's move into position.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.32,0:17:17.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's perfect, T.K.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.28,0:17:19.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmmmmm!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.72,0:17:23.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Musical fist!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.90,0:17:26.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's coming, get out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.36,0:17:29.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, check it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.38,0:17:43.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I feel like my\Nsweet little self again!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.84,0:17:45.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but this is your stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.06,0:17:49.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watch that first step.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.06,0:17:57.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Place all yours now, Davis.\NGotcha, T .I. Thunderfly!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.52,0:18:03.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know the drill, Hitmon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.52,0:18:04.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll make him eat dirt.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.14,0:18:06.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gold Rush!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.08,0:18:12.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.84,0:18:14.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, where's Yoli?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.16,0:18:16.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What? One's missing too. It figures.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.40,0:18:18.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's always up to something
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.72,0:18:23.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, we're one short, so\Nlet me introduce you to a few
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.70,0:18:28.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey fellas, I hate to inform you,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.74,0:18:32.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but the controls fires been\Ndestroyed fight time is over now
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.60,0:18:40.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I prefer subtraction.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.26,0:18:45.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where did he go?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.60,0:18:50.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I prefer subtraction.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.02,0:18:51.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Double stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.48,0:18:59.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who's number one?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.68,0:19:02.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, don't be a poor sport.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.30,0:19:06.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The next time we meet, I'm going\Nto turn you right into a fish rag.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.60,0:19:08.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Till then, pal. Ow! Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.92,0:19:15.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jureimon, have I ever told you\Nyou're the coolest guy I've ever met?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.28,0:19:18.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? Oh, Yoli?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.14,0:19:27.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gee, it looks like the\Nbig guy's all crashed out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.76,0:19:28.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's rare.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.90,0:19:31.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha ha, you're back, Yoli!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.68,0:19:33.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We were worried about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.26,0:19:34.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where have you been?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.22,0:19:35.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just here and there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.30,0:19:36.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you'd be so kind,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.86,0:19:40.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we'd appreciate it if you could\Ntake the dark spiral off his head.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.32,0:19:41.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about we chop it all off?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.76,0:19:42.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He needs a haircut anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.04,0:19:43.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.95,0:19:44.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.87,0:19:46.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's just pride and\Njoy without his costume.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.64,0:19:48.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come down, I'm kidding. Whoa! Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.08,0:19:52.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you think it was bad before,\Njust try catching him on a bad day.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.48,0:19:53.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Were they?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.39,0:19:54.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.31,0:19:55.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Davis, sometimes you're so insensitive.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.96,0:19:58.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so sensitive I use\Na special toothpaste
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.20,0:20:00.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and my teeth don't hurt\Nwhen I eat ice cream.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.24,0:20:01.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.04,0:20:05.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's zap that spiral with all we've got!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.08,0:20:07.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aqua Beam!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.38,0:20:09.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cat's eye beam!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.28,0:20:11.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thunderblast!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.52,0:20:14.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gold Rush!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.54,0:20:16.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Double star!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.94,0:20:29.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was a great siesta.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.80,0:20:32.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did anything good happen when I was out?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.60,0:20:37.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're just so glad you're\Nback to normal again.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.20,0:20:38.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.11,0:20:39.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just had a nap.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.16,0:20:39.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.07,0:20:41.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the way, I really liked your haircut.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.76,0:20:43.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Talk about changing\Nyour mind all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.70,0:20:45.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's Davis in a nutshell.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.42,0:20:47.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Davis, maybe you\Nshould get a new hairstyle.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.74,0:20:49.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about a top knot?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.26,0:20:50.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you like it, maybe I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.30,0:20:54.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like the Digidestined\Nhave defeated you again, Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.62,0:20:57.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, perhaps they think they have anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.14,0:21:00.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those halfwits have no idea what they're
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.56,0:21:03.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,up against I'm just\Nputting them in position
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.36,0:21:05.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way they'll\Nfigure out my master
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.66,0:21:08.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,plan Because I'm just\Nway too smart for them
Dialogue: 1,0:21:16.58,0:21:22.70,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Chotto matte mite dare datte kinou to maru de chigau
Dialogue: 1,0:21:22.70,0:21:28.69,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Chotto mite mite yokogao no shiruetto mo otona sa
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.70,0:21:30.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you know that I'm going\Nto be a little bitter?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:28.69,0:21:34.60,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Chotto kimi kimi iiwake wo shitai kimochi mo wakaru
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.18,0:21:33.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know if I can't believe you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.58,0:21:40.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But this morning is\Nalmost like a sad thing.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:34.60,0:21:40.77,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Datte yo no naka kore ja maru de natte nai jan
Dialogue: 1,0:21:40.77,0:21:46.79,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Da ne! Kimochi ii kuuki wo
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.00,0:21:43.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not feeling good,\Nbut this is not how bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.32,0:21:46.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not feeling good at all,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.76,0:21:52.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but it's not a bad thing.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:46.79,0:21:52.58,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Ima! Suitakute shou ga nai shou ga nai
Dialogue: 1,0:21:52.58,0:21:58.35,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Ashita wa atashi no kaze ga fuku kara ne
Dialogue: 1,0:21:58.35,0:22:04.30,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Sekaijuu no doa akete oite hoshii
Dialogue: 1,0:22:04.30,0:22:10.24,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Ashita wa atashi no kaze ga fuku kara ne
Dialogue: 1,0:22:10.24,0:22:19.10,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Kimi no sono yowamushi wo mouretsu ni fukitobasuyo
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.90,0:22:22.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go just now!
Dialogue: 1,0:22:20.70,0:22:29.50,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Gorgeous na jinsei wo!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.34,0:22:50.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a powerful Digimental!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.12,0:22:52.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a new Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.42,0:22:56.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The next Digimon Adventure 02! Submarimon!
Dialogue: 1,0:22:55.64,0:22:59.52,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,0)\fscx110\fscy110\pos(319,357)}Submarimon - Escape from the Bottom of the Sea
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.64,0:22:58.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The game has been opened!

